# Estate Stack - Port SSOT (ALL 25xxx, no hardcodes)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# herd is the rename of herd (commit af09900). HERD_PORT is the canonical
# key: src/services/registry.ts, stack/services/herd.sh, both profiles and
# ranch/yote all read it. LLAMA_SWAP_PORT below is the legacy alias for the
# files that still spell it the old way.
