# (crates/zedra-host/src/main.rs:1273), so this number is a reservation that
# keeps the port off other daemons, not a value the process reads. Candidates
# already spoken for: :25146 WHATSAPP_MCP, :25148 mbx-cache (was BRAND_PORT),
# :25213 estate-exporter, :25212 COCKPIT, :25137 bedrock-ui.
